OL,3,GNEWSACrane stop button not used before
OL,4,Aman 'crushed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn emergency stop switch on a crane had
OL,7,Fnot been pushed as it should have been
OL,8,Fbefore a delivery driver was "crushed"
OL,9,Fat a building site, an inquest has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FNigel Williamson died after he was
OL,13,Ffound injured on the back of a
OL,14,Fcrane-mounted lorry at the Kneeton
OL,15,FGrove housing development in East
OL,16,FBridgford, Nottinghamshire, on 13
OL,17,FAugust last year.
OL,19,FThe 60-year-old had been employed by
OL,20,FKRM Building Supplies for less than
OL,21,Fthree weeks at the time.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
