OL,3,GNEWSACrane stop button not used before
OL,4,Aman 'crushed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, Nottingham Coroner's Court
OL,7,Fheard a colleague who had been assigned
OL,8,Fas Williamson's "buddy" in his first
OL,9,Fweek admitted he had not used the
OL,10,Femergency button on the lorry when he
OL,11,Fshould have during that time.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
